# ==============================================================================
# Emission line list for MOCASSIN / PyNeb line intensity integration
#
# Format:
#   Ion   Wavelength   Type   Label
#
# Notes:
#   - Ion: Element symbol followed by spectrum number (e.g. O3 for O III, H1 for H I)
#   - Wavelength: in Angstroms (e.g. 5006.84) or microns (e.g. 157.7m or 1577287)
#   - Type: 'CEL' (Collisional Excitation Line) or 'REC' (Optical Recombination Line)
#   - Label: Optional descriptive text
# ==============================================================================

